Adapted files
-------------

src/engine/uciSession.ts
  Adapted from Chesskit src/lib/engine/worker.ts (sendCommandsToWorker).
  The multi-worker pool is not used. One classic Worker loads the
  unmodified single-threaded Stockfish build.

src/lib/winPercent.ts
  Adapted from Chesskit src/lib/engine/helpers/winPercentage.ts
  (getWinPercentageFromCp). The curve is the Lichess win-percent
  formula cited in that file.

The animated board, click-to-jump move list, keyboard stepping, and
best-move arrows follow the review behaviour of Chesskit
src/components/board/index.tsx. That component is not copied. It depends
on Material UI and Jotai, which this project does not use. The board
widget is react-chessboard (MIT), installed from npm.

Stockfish
---------

public/vendor/stockfish/ contains unmodified files from the stockfish.js
18.0.8 package (single-threaded lite build) plus that package's
Copying.txt (GNU GPL version 3). They are loaded only with new Worker().
They are not bundled into the application JavaScript.

